<div class=3DWordSection1>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><u><span
style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'><o:p><span style=3D'text-decorat=
ion:
 none'>&nbsp;</span></o:p></span></u></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><u><span
style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>Zion - Resident Extraction<o:p><=
/o:p></span></u></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>Mission Objective(s):<o:p></o:p>=
</span></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>The c=
rew of
the Isis is doing a regular <span class=3DGramE>Blue</span> pill extraction=
. They
have meme traps in place to Extract <span class=3DGramE>a</span> RSI from a
Matrix power plant. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'><o:p>=
&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>Searc=
hing for
prospective <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Red Pill Targets</i> in=
volves
the Operator scanning for strange signals, glitches, or programming the <i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>Matrix Power Plant</i>. The Operator&#=
8217;s
god like view of the Matrix helps the <span class=3DGramE>RSI&#8217;s</span=
> in
the Matrix spot things they can&#8217;t see because of the <i style=3D'mso-=
bidi-font-style:
normal'>Simulacrum</i>. Having an Operator co-pilot from the ship, while
RSI&#8217;s run around looking for clues is the least efficient way to sear=
ch
for red pill targets in the Matrix. <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'=
>(Doing
things that are illegal is the easiest way to scrounge up recruits. Red pil=
l targets
will usually be found among the outcast of society. They might seem depress=
ed
or strung out on drugs, but that is a side effect of realizing that there is
something wrong with the world around you.)</i> <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'><o:p>=
&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<ol style=3D'margin-top:0in' start=3D1 type=3D1>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1'><span style=3D'fon=
t-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif'>Locate a red target<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <ol style=3D'margin-top:0in' start=3D1 type=3Da>
  <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level2 lfo1'><span style=3D'fo=
nt-family:
      "Calibri",sans-serif'>This is done by hanging out in areas they might
      frequent, depending on the meme the group is using to reach their red
      targets. A good team will have reds come to them. The reds will find =
them
      by following the riddles and puzzles that the team carefully <span
      class=3DGramE>places</span> in the Matrix, drawing the reds into the =
flaws
      of the world around them.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 </ol>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1'><span style=3D'fon=
t-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif'>ID &amp; Surveillance target before extraction. =
Make
     sure it is not a trap by the Machines.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <ol style=3D'margin-top:0in' start=3D1 type=3Da>
  <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level2 lfo1'><span style=3D'fo=
nt-family:
      "Calibri",sans-serif'>ID the red by testing them on the meme being us=
ed.
      Riddles are a common way to root out an Agent trap.<o:p></o:p></span>=
</li>
  <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level2 lfo1'><span style=3D'fo=
nt-family:
      "Calibri",sans-serif'>Machines are good at bugging <span class=3DGram=
E>reds</span>
      before Zion RSIs contact them. The Machines wipe the <span class=3DGr=
amE>red&#8217;s</span>
      memory making it seem like a dream to the red. This puts all the RSIs=
 in
      danger. Once the Agents know what&#8217;s going on they can thwart the
      extraction.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
  <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level2 lfo1'><span style=3D'fo=
nt-family:
      "Calibri",sans-serif'>(Debugging) Experienced RSIs are used to their
      targets being bugged. Zion RSIs will normally scan a subject for bugs=
 as
      part of their surveillance, before any information is exchanged.<o:p>=
</o:p></span></li>
 </ol>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1'><span style=3D'fon=
t-family:
     "Calibri",sans-serif'>Contact the red pill target. Offer the red targe=
t a
     choice as to whether they would like <span class=3DGramE>be</span> ext=
racted
