<p class=3DMsoNormal><span style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>This =
Matrix
Power Plant is designed around a Denver cityscape. I imagine above ground
trains running through the neighborhoods and downtown. Mountains border the
city on the west. I get the feel that it is <span class=3DGramE>a darker</s=
pan>
than the Denver I know today. In my imagination this MATRIX Denver is gray =
with
spots of bright neon. Neon signs add a little color to the cityscape. I ima=
gine
the city is larger, but no more industrial than it is now. The city has more
office buildings and people on the street <span class=3DGramE>than</span> p=
resent
day Denver does. There are lots of <span class=3DGramE>high rise</span>
office/residential buildings in the matrix version of Denver.<o:p></o:p></s=
pan></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style=3D'font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=3DMsoNormal><span class=3DSpellE><b style=3D'mso-bidi-font-weight:=
normal'><span
