8221;.
They find Billy at Dante&#8217;s Inferno when they talk with the Bartender
&#8220;Raven&#8221;. Dante&#8217;s is known for allowing underage kids to p=
arty
and <span class=3DGramE>the Billy</span> has been here partying for awhile.=
 The
bartender points him out after the group gives her some of the ZAP drug.<o:=
p></o:p></span></p>

